---
import AppDocLayout from '../../layouts/AppDocLayout.astro';
---

<AppDocLayout
  title="Set Easy - Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Set Easy, the strength training log for iPhone and Apple Watch."
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/set-easy/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] mb-12">Set Easy - Gym Workout Tracker &middot; Effective October 22, 2026</p>
        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">The short version</h2>
            <p>Set Easy doesn't collect, sell or send your data anywhere. Your workouts stay on your devices.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Workout data</h2>
            <p>Your workouts, sets, exercises, personal bests and settings are stored on your iPhone. The Set Easy widgets read a summary of them on the same device. There are no accounts and nothing to sign in to.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Apple Watch</h2>
            <p>If you use Set Easy on Apple Watch, your iPhone sends it your workouts and last weights, and the watch sends finished workouts back, directly between your own devices.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Apple Health</h2>
            <p>Apple Health is optional and off until you turn it on in Settings. When it's on, Set Easy saves each workout you finish to Apple Health as a strength training workout with its start and end time, and reads your heart rate during a workout to show your average and highest heart rate in History. Health data is never used for anything else, never leaves your device and Apple Health, and is never shared with anyone. You can change access any time in the Health app.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Exports and backups</h2>
            <p>When you export your history or make a backup, Set Easy creates a file and hands it to the share sheet. Where it goes from there is up to you. Importing reads only the file you pick.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Analytics and tracking</h2>
            <p>Set Easy has no analytics, no ads, no tracking and no third-party code. It makes no network requests of its own.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Children</h2>
            <p>Set Easy doesn't knowingly collect information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Changes and contact</h2>
            <p>If this policy changes, this page will show the new date. For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com?subject=Set%20Easy%20Privacy" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</AppDocLayout>
